UnitVotingRewardsManager::ClaimFees
├── when the recipient is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when the recipient is not the zero address
    ├── when the checkpoint limit is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroCheckpoints
    └── when the checkpoint limit is not zero
        ├── when the caller is not the voter or the registered operator
        │   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
        └── when the caller is authorized
            ├── when there are no pending fees
            │   ├── when the claim does not reach the latest checkpoint
            │   │   ├── given no fee token is the wrapped native
            │   │   │   ├── it should not collect the gauge fees
            │   │   │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
            │   │   │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
            │   │   │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            │   │   └── given a fee token is the wrapped native
            │   │       ├── given unwrapping is supported
            │   │       │   ├── it should unwrap the wrapped native fee token
            │   │       │   ├── it should send the native token to the recipient
            │   │       │   ├── it should transfer the other owed token to the recipient
            │   │       │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            │   │       └── given unwrapping is not supported
            │   │           ├── it should transfer the wrapped native fee token as an ERC20 token
            │   │           ├── it should not send native token to the recipient
            │   │           └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            │   └── when the claim reaches the latest checkpoint
            │       ├── when the stake has no active voting power
            │       │   ├── it should not collect the gauge fees
            │       │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
            │       │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
            │       │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            │       └── when the stake has active voting power
            │           ├── when the credited fees vary
            │           │   ├── it should collect the gauge fees
            │           │   ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
            │           │   ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
            │           │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
            │           │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
            │           │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            │           └── when the credited fees are known
            │               ├── it should collect the gauge fees
            │               ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
            │               ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
            │               ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
            │               ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
            │               └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
            └── when there are pending fees
                ├── when the accumulator was already updated in the current timestamp
                │   ├── when the accrued fees vary
                │   │   ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                │   │   ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                │   │   ├── it should buffer the fees accrued since the last update
                │   │   ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                │   │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                │   │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                │   │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                │   └── when the accrued fees are known
                │       ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                │       ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                │       ├── it should buffer the fees accrued since the last update
                │       ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                │       ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                │       ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                │       └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                └── when the accumulator was not updated in the current timestamp
                    ├── when the credit does not advance the accumulator
                    │   ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                    │   ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                    │   ├── it should not create a new global reward point
                    │   ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                    │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                    │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                    │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                    └── when the credit advances the accumulator
                        ├── when the claim does not reach the latest user checkpoint
                        │   ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                        │   ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                        │   ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
                        │   ├── it should create a new global reward point
                        │   ├── it should not extend the claim range to the new global checkpoint
                        │   ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                        │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                        │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                        │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                        └── when the claim reaches the latest user checkpoint
                            ├── when the stake is owed rewards
                            │   ├── when the rewards vary
                            │   │   ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                            │   │   ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                            │   │   ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
                            │   │   ├── it should create a new global reward point
                            │   │   ├── it should extend the claim range to the new global checkpoint
                            │   │   ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                            │   │   ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                            │   │   ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                            │   │   └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                            │   └── when the rewards are known
                            │       ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                            │       ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                            │       ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
                            │       ├── it should create a new global reward point
                            │       ├── it should extend the claim range to the new global checkpoint
                            │       ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                            │       ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                            │       ├── it should transfer the owed token rewards to the recipient
                            │       └── it should emit the ClaimFees event for each owed token
                            └── when the stake is not owed rewards
                                ├── it should collect the gauge fees
                                ├── it should emit the FeesCollected event for each collected token
                                ├── it should credit the collected fees to the accumulator
                                ├── it should create a new global reward point
                                ├── it should extend the claim range to the new global checkpoint
                                ├── it should clear the last pending fees
                                ├── it should persist the updated fee claim state
                                └── it should not transfer any token rewards
